_vrf_THETM01_delta_moc_68_cb10
;
PROBLEM: The value of sine(theta_max)/wavelength is less than 0.550
RESPONSE: Although we have used Cu radiation, long exposure time,
and best crystal obtained to collect the best data set. The crystals immediately
lost solvent after removal from the mother liquor. The weak diffraction makes
the reflection in the high angle not complete.
;
